question:
What will be the output of the following C program?
```
#include <stdio.h>

union values {
    int val1;
    char val2;
} myVal;

int main()
{
    myVal.val1 = 66;

    printf("val1 = %p", &myVal.val1);
    printf("\nval2 = %p", &myVal.val2);

    return 0;
}
```

